# Tests required (QA-001)

A change is not done until it has tests and they pass.

- Every new route gets tests in `tests/test_<feature>.py` using the `client` fixture from `tests/conftest.py`.
- Cover at minimum: the happy path, 401 without identity, 403 without the role (`NO_ROLES` headers), and invalid input (422).
- Send identity with the `READER` headers from `tests/conftest.py`.
- Before finishing, run `ruff check .` and `pytest -q` and fix anything that fails. CI runs the same checks and `main` will not accept a PR without them passing.
